<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Petra Mining cautions talks continue.</title>
<headline>Petra Mining cautions talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petra Mining Ltd said on Monday that talks first referred to on April 16 were still in progress and could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
